      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Should tack on that while I understand that archiving is one thing, this can violate the privacy of a lot of avatar creators who want to understandably keep their avatars, well, private, and don't want their work reuploaded by some guy who found it on a site where he could exchange it for potentially yet someone else's work.",
