      "statusChangeID": "637e831d1d3665703469bea3",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Thank you for reporting this!\nWe're concerned about ripping in VRChat and are actively working on improving the situation.\nPlease understand that we can't share many details on this as it's a security issue. However, we continue to make changes to improve the situation and have taken other non-technical actions we cannot disclose.\nFrom our observation, the incidence rate of content ripping since late July 2022 has dropped dramatically. It has not disappeared completely and never will, as ripping is an unsolvable problem.\nHowever, we will continue to focus security efforts on this issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
